// THE COMMISSIONER'S CONTROLS SIT DIRECTLY ABOVE THE NAV MENU BUTTON, and this
// file's whole job is that they are the same object as it. The paint, the
// height, the radius, the tracking and the focus ring all come from
// prose_floating_action() in app/styles/prose-form.styl, which menu.styl calls
// too -- see the argument there for why $prose_action and why the accent only on
// hover.
//
// WHAT THIS REPLACED: a MUI SpeedDial (`.MuiSpeedDial-root.MuiSpeedDial-directionUp`)
// with a MUI Backdrop and two SpeedDialActions, positioned by
// `bottom ($auctionHeightMobile + 48 + 8 + 16)` unconditionally and `bottom
// 160px` above 1160px. Both were hand-summed constants that had stopped
// describing anything -- 48 was a FAB height the menu button has not had since it
// went to 38, and 160 was the desktop chrome before it was 164.
//
// NOTHING HERE IS HAND-SUMMED NOW. auction_chrome_bottom() reads the chrome's
// MEASURED height off `--auction-controls-height`, which auction-controls.js
// publishes from a ResizeObserver, and the offset above the menu button is
// arithmetic on $floating_action_height rather than a second copy of it. Move
// the menu button's height and this follows; move the chrome and both follow.

// THE MENU BUTTON'S OWN OFFSET, PLUS THE MENU BUTTON, PLUS A GAP -- in that
// order, because that is what "above the menu button" means as arithmetic. The
// leading 8px is the gap menu.styl passes for the button itself; the trailing
// 8px is the gap between the two controls.
$commissioner_controls_offset = 8px + $floating_action_height + 8px

// Not inside the stack, so the stack's z-index does not have to sit above a
// child of its own. Fixed to the viewport rather than to the control.
.commissioner-controls__backdrop
  position fixed
  inset 0
  background rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)
  z-index $z_overlay_backdrop
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color transparent

// A COLUMN ANCHORED BY ITS BOTTOM, which is what makes the actions open UPWARD
// without any of them knowing how many there are. The toggle is the last child,
// so its bottom edge is the offset below and everything else grows off the top.
.commissioner-controls__stack
  position fixed
  z-index $z_overlay_panel
  display flex
  flex-direction column
  // `stretch`, so the actions and the toggle share one width -- the widest
  // label's. A ragged right edge on a stack of three buttons in a corner reads
  // as three controls rather than as one menu.
  align-items stretch
  gap 8px

.commissioner-controls__actions
  display flex
  flex-direction column
  gap 8px

.commissioner-controls__toggle
.commissioner-controls__action
  prose_floating_action()
  // The asymmetric padding prose_floating_action() carries corrects a label sat
  // left of centre by its own trailing letter-space, which is a shrink-to-fit
  // problem. These boxes are stretched to a shared width instead, so the label
  // is centred outright and the correction has nothing to correct.
  justify-content center

.auction__commissioner-controls
  @media (min-width 1160px)
    .commissioner-controls__stack
      left 16px
      bottom auction_chrome_bottom(
        $auctionHeightDesktop,
        $commissioner_controls_offset
      )

  @media (max-width 1159px)
    .commissioner-controls__stack
      left 16px
      bottom auction_chrome_bottom(
        $auctionHeightMobile,
        $commissioner_controls_offset
      )

  // THE SAME EDGE THE MENU BUTTON MOVES TO, and for the same reason menu.styl
  // gives: below 800 the drawer comes in from the right, so the control that
  // opens it sits on that edge and under the thumb rather than across the screen
  // from it. This one is not that control, but it is stacked on top of it, and a
  // pair that swaps sides at a breakpoint is not a pair.
  //
  // MUST STAY BELOW the max-width 1159px block. Both are the same specificity
  // and the cascade decides on source order, so reordering these silently drops
  // the side rail term -- exactly the note menu.styl carries over its own copy.
  @media (max-width 800px)
    .commissioner-controls__stack
      left auto
      right 16px
      bottom auction_chrome_side_bottom(
        $auctionHeightMobile,
        $commissioner_controls_offset
      )
